// This FSM makes the trigger invisible in game, but displays an icon in the editor to make map making clearer.
// Frame 0 is the icon that appears in the editor.
// Frame 1 is a 1x1 transparent pixel, which is specified below to make the decoration appear invisible in game.

image trigger_specimen_2 1 1

state IDLE NONE 0
frame 1 0.25 0 0 0 READY